[node name="Label2" type="Label" parent="Control/HBoxContainer/VBoxContainer"]
layout_mode = 2
text = "Spectre is a disruptive alien with a speed that increases or decreases based off the spin speed of its trusty scythe. The scythe ramps up in speed over time, restarting whenever it hits the ball. The handle/back bats the ball away, while the metal blade makes it disappear after a short delay. Unfortunately, due to its ghostly nature, Spectre itself cannot make contact with the ball.

Default - Reflect
Cooldown: 100
Duration: N/A
Spectre changes the direction of its scythe rotation, maintaining the same spin speed and momentum.

Ultimate - Deathly Reap
Charge: 500
Duration: 150
Spectre boosts the spin speed of its scythe and both sides immediately make the ball disappear.
"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_jkvo6")
autowrap_mode = 2

